    {
      "text": "Hosanna in the highest, Matt. 21:9 (Mark 11:10). shall be called the Son of the Highest, Luke 1:32. called the prophet of the Highest, Luke 1:76. Glory to God in the highest, Luke 2:14. ye shall be the children of the Highest, Luke 6:35. sit not down in the highest room, Luke 14:8. Friend, go up higher, Luke 14:10. highest seats in the synagogues, Luke 20:46. endued with power from on high, Luke 24:49. that sabbath day was an high day, John 19:31. most High dwelleth not in temples, Acts 7:48. every high thing that exalteth itself, 2 Cor. 10:5. against spiritual wickedness in high places, Eph. 6:12. for the prize of the high calling of God, Philip. 3:14. such an high priest … made higher than the heavens, Heb. 7:26.",
